TESTSUITE "qualified names declared twice"

TESTCASE "doubles the amount"
    MOVE -12.34 TO TXN-AMT OF IN-TXN
    MOVE 1.5 TO TXN-QTY OF IN-TXN
    MOVE 125 TO RATE OF IN-TOTALS
    PERFORM 0000-MAIN
    EXPECT TXN-AMT OF OUT-TXN TO BE -24.68
    EXPECT TXN-QTY OF OUT-TXN TO BE 2.5
    EXPECT TXN-AMT-ED OF OUT-TXN TO BE -24.68
    EXPECT TXN-AMT-ED OF OUT-TXN TO BE LESS THAN 0 AND GREATER THAN -25
    EXPECT TXN-AMT-ED OF OUT-TXN TO BE -24.68 OR -1
    EXPECT RATE OF OUT-TOTALS TO BE 1.25
